{"file_id":"BRIEFING_MISSION_BLOCK_36F0E0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"看到了吗，Snake！刚才那个巨型兵器！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":50,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"那到底是什么？看起来像是无人兵器。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"无人兵器……？原来如此。虽然听说过传闻，没想到已经造出来了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"这里到底发生了什么？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"不是我非要附和Amanda，但他们投入的这批兵器数量实在太不正常了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"明显过头了。十有八九，核武器确实已经被带进来了……问题在于，他们打算拿核武器做什么。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":126,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"我还想要更多情报。现在的判断依据太少。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"怎么办？作为情报源的<R=司令官,COMANDANTE>已经死了。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=司令官,COMANDANTE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"不，至少他的女儿Amanda还平安无事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"原来如此，追着她们走吗……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"Snake，去下一个据点。如果Amanda没事，我们应该还能再和她接触。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":86,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"明白。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""}]}